// =============================================================================
// APP STORE / GOOGLE PLAY SUBSCRIPTIONS - TURNED OFF
//
// These tables are commented out on purpose. They are not created by any
// migration and no code touches them, so a product that never sells anything
// carries no billing schema at all.
//
// Need subscriptions?
//   1. Uncomment everything below.
//   2. bun run --cwd backend prisma:migrate
//   3. Follow "How To Turn Subscriptions On" in docs/IAP.md - it lists the
//      remaining steps (delete the type stand-ins, mount the routes).
//
// Sure you will never need them?
//   Follow "If Subscriptions Are Not Wanted" in docs/IAP.md - a few neutral files
//   reference billing and have to be cleaned up in the same pass.
//
// Reference implementation: github.com/di-sukharev/vibe, branch `mobile`.
// =============================================================================

